-title>Cutaneous malignant melanoma in Scotland</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1992</year><volume>339</volume><fpage>971</fpage><lpage>975</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||339|971||bib16|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1348807</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mackie</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bray</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hole</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Morris</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Nicolson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Doherty</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Vestey</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Incidence of and survival from malignant melanoma in Scotland: an epidemiological study</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2002</year><volume>260</volume><fpage>587</fpage><lpage>591</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||260|587||bib17|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mackie</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Hole</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Hunter</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Rankin</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Mclaren</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Fallowfield</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hutcheon</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><collab>Morris A on behalf of the Scottish Melanoma Group</collab></person-group><article-title>Cutaneous melanoma in Scotland: incidence survival and mortality 1979&#x02013;1994<